      "title": "How to Build a Company Brain That Gets Smarter Every Week",
      "preview_text": "Turn every correction and decision your team gives AI into one company brain.",
      "cover_media": {},
      "content": {
        "blocks": [
          {"type": "unstyled", "text": "Right now the smartest AI in your company probably works for one person, and nobody else can see what it knows.", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "header-two", "text": "Why the knowledge stays trapped", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "unstyled", "text": "One teammate has a chat that understands the strategy. Another has taught a coding agent how you ship. The intelligence is real and it is invisible.", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "unordered-list-item", "text": "Corrections live in private threads", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "unordered-list-item", "text": "Decisions are never written down twice", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "blockquote", "text": "A company brain is the difference between a team that learns and a team that repeats itself.", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "header-two", "text": "The weekly loop", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "ordered-list-item", "text": "Collect every correction the team made this week", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "ordered-list-item", "text": "Fold them into one shared document", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "ordered-list-item", "text": "Hand that document to every agent on Monday", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "unstyled", "text": "", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []},
          {"type": "unstyled", "text": "Do that for a quarter and the compounding is obvious to everyone who was skeptical at the start.", "inlineStyleRanges": [], "entityRanges": []}
        ],
